	"stringtable": {
		"spell_ambessap_tooltip": "When Ambessa is casting an Ability, issuing a Move or Attack order will cause her to dash in that direction after the Ability finishes.<br><br>Each cast initiation grants her a charge for @Attack_Buff_Duration@ seconds (max: @Attack_Buff_Max_Stacks@). While Ambessa has a charge, she gains <attention>@Attack_Range_Amount@ %i:scaleRange% Attack Range</attention> and <attackSpeed>@Calc_Attack_Speed@ %i:scaleAS% Attack Speed</attackSpeed>. Attacks consume a charge to deal <physicalDamage>@Calc_OnHit_Damage_Flat@ physical damage</physicalDamage> and restore <keywordMajor>@Calc_OnHit_Energy_Refund@ Energy</keywordMajor>."
